  integer of house `≤ B G^E`, and Liouville's inequality gives
  `1 ≤ G^E |F w| (B G^E)^([K:ℚ] - 1)`.
* Together, `2^(N^l) ≤ exp (C L N)`. With `L^d ≤ c M^l ≤ c N^l` and `d l ≥ d + l + 1` this forces
